  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till EAJA Konstutionella m&#xf6;te</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to EAJA General Meeting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insats av st&#xf6;djande karakt&#xe4;r f&#xf6;r ett planerat st&#xf6;d till Eastern       Africa Journalist Association (EAJA)i &#xd6;stafrika. Denna insats ska     st&#xf6;dja ett konstiutionellt m&#xf6;te som EAJA ska h&#xe5;lla i Maj 2013 f&#xf6;r att komma till r&#xe4;tta med vissa organisationsf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndingar som kr&#xe4;vs f&#xf6;r att ett l&#xe4;ngre st&#xf6;d till organisationen ska kunna beviljas. St&#xf6;det        kanaliseras genom det Internationella Journalistf&#xf6;rbundet IFJ.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is a pre-support to Eastern Africa Journalist       Association (EAJA)in East Africa. It will be a support to EAJA&apos;s      General Meeting to be held in May 2013 for EAJA to make constiutional changes in their organisation in order to be able to receive          long-term support. The support will be channelled to IFJ, the         Internation Federation of Journalist to facilitate the meeting.</narrative>
  </description>
